#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: mixmymeals.php
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:960
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:961
msgid "MixMyMeals"
msgstr "MixMyMeals"

#. Author of the plugin
#: mixmymeals.php
msgid "Timo Fricke"
msgstr "Timo Fricke"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:159
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Allgemeine Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:160
msgid "Currency, placeholder image, meal slug, visitor plans, privacy and input notices. Slugs and archive texts for recipes, ingredients, equipment and plans live on their own tabs."
msgstr "Währung, Platzhalterbild, Mahlzeiten-Slug, Besucherpläne, Datenschutz und Eingabehinweise. Slugs und Archivtexte für Rezepte, Zutaten, Küchengeräte und Pläne stehen in eigenen Tabs."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:166
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Anzeige"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:170
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "Währung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:171
msgid "Currency symbol used for price display."
msgstr "Währungssymbol für die Preisanzeige."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:178
msgid "Placeholder Image"
msgstr "Platzhalterbild"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:179
msgid "Used only as a fallback for social link previews and Instagram slide backgrounds. On the website, recipes without a photo are shown cookbook-style with their title only."
msgstr "Wird nur noch als Fallback für Social-Link-Vorschauen und Instagram-Hintergründe verwendet. Auf der Website erscheinen Rezepte ohne Foto im Kochbuch-Stil nur mit ihrem Titel."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:191
msgid "Slugs & Permalinks"
msgstr "Slugs & Permalinks"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:195
msgid "Meal Slug"
msgstr "Mahlzeit-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:196
msgid "Set the prefix for meals in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Mahlzeiten in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:220
msgid "Visitor Plans"
msgstr "Besucherpläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:224
msgid "Public Mode"
msgstr "Öffentlicher Modus"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:225
msgid "Allow every visitor to publish plans."
msgstr "Erlaube jedem jedem Besucher, Pläne zu veröffentlichen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:235
msgid "Meal Plans per Hour"
msgstr "Pläne pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:236
msgid "How many plans should a visitor be allowed to publish per hour?"
msgstr "Wie viele Pläne soll ein Besucher pro Stunde veröffentlichen dürfen?"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:246
msgid "Set visitor plans to draft"
msgstr "Setze Besucherpläne auf Entwurf"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:247
msgid "Save visitor plans as drafts."
msgstr "Pläne von Besuchern als Entwürfe speichern."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:257
msgid "Alternative Redirect"
msgstr "Alternative Umleitung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:258
msgid "Where to send visitors after their new plan has been saved as a draft."
msgstr "Wohin Besucher geleitet werden, nachdem ihr neuer Plan als Entwurf gespeichert wurde."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:269
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:273
msgid "Delete data on uninstall"
msgstr "Daten bei Deinstallation löschen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:274
msgid "When the plugin is deleted, also remove personal data (newsletter subscriptions, ratings and visitor photos). Recipes and plans are always kept. Off by default so an accidental deletion does not destroy records."
msgstr "Beim Löschen des Plugins auch personenbezogene Daten entfernen (Newsletter-Abos, Bewertungen und Besucherfotos). Rezepte und Pläne bleiben immer erhalten. Standardmäßig aus, damit ein versehentliches Löschen keine Datensätze zerstört."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:282
msgid "Visitor Input Notices"
msgstr "Hinweise bei Besucher-Eingaben"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:286
msgid "Rating / review notice"
msgstr "Hinweis bei Bewertung/Rezension"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:287
msgid "Shown on the rating and review form on recipe pages (e.g. a note that reviews are moderated). Leave empty to hide."
msgstr "Erscheint im Bewertungs- und Rezensionsformular auf Rezeptseiten (z.B. Hinweis, dass Rezensionen moderiert werden). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:294
msgid "Photo upload notice"
msgstr "Hinweis beim Foto-Upload"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:295
msgid "Shown on the meal-photo upload form (e.g. that you grant usage rights and photos are reviewed). Leave empty to hide."
msgstr "Erscheint im Foto-Upload-Formular (z.B. dass du Nutzungsrechte einräumst und Fotos geprüft werden). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:302
msgid "Subscription notice"
msgstr "Hinweis beim Abonnieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:303
msgid "Shown on the meal-plan subscription form, below the consent checkbox. Leave empty to hide."
msgstr "Erscheint im Abo-Formular unter der Einwilligungs-Checkbox. Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:310
msgid "Plan creation notice"
msgstr "Hinweis bei Plan-Erstellung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:311
msgid "Shown next to the “Create meal plan” button (visitor plan creation). Leave empty to hide."
msgstr "Erscheint neben dem „Plan erstellen“-Button (Plan-Erstellung durch Besucher). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:320
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:267
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:750
msgid "Recipes"
msgstr "Rezepte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:321
msgid "Recipe URL slugs, archive display and the recipe disclaimer."
msgstr "Rezept-URL-Slugs, Archiv-Darstellung und der Rezept-Disclaimer."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:327
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:421
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:462
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:517
msgid "URL Slugs"
msgstr "URL-Slugs"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:331
msgid "Recipe Slug"
msgstr "Rezept-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:332
msgid "Set the prefix for recipes in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Rezepte in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:343
msgid "Recipe Category Slug"
msgstr "Kategorie-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:344
msgid "Set the prefix for recipe categories in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Kategorien in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:356
msgid "Archive & Display"
msgstr "Archiv & Anzeige"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:360
msgid "Recipe Disclaimer"
msgstr "Rezept-Disclaimer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:361
msgid "Write a disclaimer for your recipes."
msgstr "Schreibe einen Disclaimer für deine Rezepte."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:372
msgid "Recipe Archive Description"
msgstr "Rezeptarchivbeschreibung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:373
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:443
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:484
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:580
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:592
msgid "This description will be used by the corresponding shortcode."
msgstr "Diese Beschreibung wird vom zugehörigen Shortcode genutzt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:385
msgid "Cooking Steps"
msgstr "Zubereitungsschritte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:389
msgid "Steps on Recipe Pages"
msgstr "Schritte auf Rezeptseiten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:390
msgid "Show the cooking steps on the recipe page. When switched off, only the note below is shown there and the steps remain available on the meal pages."
msgstr "Zeigt die Zubereitungsschritte auf der Rezeptseite. Ist die Option aus, erscheint dort nur der Hinweis unten; die Schritte bleiben auf den Mahlzeitenseiten verfügbar."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:401
msgid "Note Instead of Steps"
msgstr "Hinweis statt Schritte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:402
msgid "Shown on the recipe page in place of the steps while “Steps on Recipe Pages” is switched off. Leave empty to output nothing at all."
msgstr "Wird auf der Rezeptseite anstelle der Schritte angezeigt, solange „Schritte auf Rezeptseiten“ ausgeschaltet ist. Leer lassen, um gar nichts auszugeben."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:415
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:396
msgid "Ingredients"
msgstr "Zutaten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:416
msgid "Ingredient URL slug and archive display."
msgstr "URL-Slug und Archivanzeige für Zutaten."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:425
msgid "Ingredient Slug"
msgstr "Zutaten-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:426
msgid "Set the prefix for ingredients in the URL."
msgstr "Lege das Präfix für Zutaten in der URL fest."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:438
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:479
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Archiv"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:442
msgid "Ingredient Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Zutaten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:456
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:633
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:634
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:637
msgid "Equipment"
msgstr "Küchengeräte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:457
msgid "Equipment URL slug, archive display and affiliate links."
msgstr "URL-Slug, Archivanzeige und Affiliate-Links für Küchengeräte."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:466
msgid "Equipment Slug"
msgstr "Küchengeräte-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:467
msgid "Set the prefix for equipment in the URL. Changing it flushes the permalinks."
msgstr "Legt das Präfix für Küchengeräte in der URL fest. Eine Änderung erneuert die Permalinks."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:483
msgid "Equipment Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Küchengeräte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:496
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-meta.php:3803
msgid "Affiliate links"
msgstr "Affiliate-Links"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:500
msgid "Affiliate disclosure"
msgstr "Werbekennzeichnung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:501
msgid "Shown below the shop links on equipment pages. Affiliate links must be labelled as advertising; leave empty to use the built-in wording."
msgstr "Erscheint unter den Shop-Links auf Geräteseiten. Affiliate-Links müssen als Werbung gekennzeichnet werden; leer lassen nutzt den eingebauten Text."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:510
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:478
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:483
msgid "Meal Plans"
msgstr "Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:511
msgid "Setup meal plans."
msgstr "Konfiguriere Essenspläne."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:521
msgid "Meal Plan Slug"
msgstr "Essensplan-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:522
msgid "Set the prefix for meal plans in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Essenspläne in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:533
msgid "Meal Plan Category Slug"
msgstr "Essensplan Kategorie-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:534
msgid "Set the prefix for meal plan categories in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Essensplankategorien in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:546
msgid "Planner"
msgstr "Planer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:550
msgid "Max. meals in planner"
msgstr "Max. Mahlzeiten im Planer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:551
msgid "How many meals should be allowed in the planner?"
msgstr "Wie viele Mahlzeiten sollen im Planer erlaubt sein?"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:562
msgid "Individual Tab Label"
msgstr "Bezeichnung für den Individuell-Tab"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:563
msgid "Label for the \"Individual\" tab in the meal plan switcher."
msgstr "Bezeichnung für den „Individuell“-Tab im Essensplan-Umschalter."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:566
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-shortcodes.php:6907
msgid "Individual"
msgstr "Individuell"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:575
msgid "Archive Descriptions"
msgstr "Archiv-Beschreibungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:579
msgid "Meal Plan Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:591
msgid "Individual Meal Plans Description"
msgstr "Beschreibung für individuelle Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:604
msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "Aufräumen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:608
msgid "Enable Cleanup"
msgstr "Aufräumen aktivieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:609
msgid "Automatically delete orphaned meals and old meal plans without a category once per day."
msgstr "Verwaiste Mahlzeiten und alte Mahlzeitenpläne ohne Kategorie einmal täglich automatisch löschen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:620
msgid "Cleanup Minimum Age"
msgstr "Mindestalter für das Aufräumen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:621
msgid "Only delete items older than this many days."
msgstr "Nur Einträge löschen, die älter als diese Anzahl Tage sind."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:632
msgid "Cleanup Report"
msgstr "Aufräum-Bericht"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:633
msgid "E-mail a summary after each cleanup run, including deletions made by the mail log, the Instagram image cleanup and the subscription retention (only when something was deleted)."
msgstr "Nach jedem Aufräumlauf eine Zusammenfassung per E-Mail senden, inklusive der Löschungen aus Sendeprotokoll, Instagram-Bildaufräumung und Abo-Aufbewahrung (nur wenn etwas gelöscht wurde)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:644
msgid "Report Recipient"
msgstr "Berichtsempfänger"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:645
msgid "Address the cleanup report is sent to. Leave empty to use the site admin e-mail."
msgstr "Adresse, an die der Aufräum-Bericht gesendet wird. Leer lassen, um die Admin-E-Mail der Seite zu verwenden.Adresse, an die der Aufräum-Bericht gesendet wird. Leer lassen, um die Admin-E-Mail der Seite zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:658
msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:659
msgid "Sender identity and privacy options for e-mails sent by the plugin."
msgstr "Absenderidentität und Datenschutz-Optionen für E-Mails, die das Plugin versendet.Absenderidentität und Datenschutz-Optionen für E-Mails, die das Plugin versendet."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:665
msgid "Sender Identity"
msgstr "Absender-Identität"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:669
msgid "Sender Name"
msgstr "Absendername"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:670
msgid "Name shown as the e-mail sender. Defaults to the site title."
msgstr "Name, der als Absender angezeigt wird. Standard ist der Seitentitel."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:678
msgid "Sender Address"
msgstr "Absenderadresse"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:679
msgid "From address for outgoing e-mails. Leave empty to use no-reply@your-domain."
msgstr "Absenderadresse für ausgehende E-Mails. Leer lassen, um no-reply@deine-domain zu verwenden.Absenderadresse für ausgehende E-Mails. Leer lassen, um no-reply@deine-domain zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:691
msgid "Content & Privacy"
msgstr "Inhalt & Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:695
msgid "E-Mail Footer"
msgstr "E-Mail-Fußzeile"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:696
msgid "Footer added to e-mails (e.g. imprint, data controller, opt-out note). HTML allowed."
msgstr "Fußzeile, die an E-Mails angehängt wird (z. B. Impressum, Verantwortlicher, Abmeldehinweis). HTML erlaubt.Fußzeile, die an E-Mails angehängt wird (z. B. Impressum, Verantwortlicher, Abmeldehinweis). HTML erlaubt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:707
msgid "Suppression List"
msgstr "Sperrliste"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:708
msgid "Opted-out addresses, one per line. These never receive non-transactional e-mails."
msgstr "Abgemeldete Adressen, eine pro Zeile. Diese erhalten keine nicht-transaktionalen E-Mails.Abgemeldete Adressen, eine pro Zeile. Diese erhalten keine nicht-transaktionalen E-Mails."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:719
msgid "Send Log"
msgstr "Sendeprotokoll"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:720
msgid "Keep a log of sent e-mails (recipient, subject, status — no message content)."
msgstr "Ein Protokoll versendeter E-Mails führen (Empfänger, Betreff, Status – keine Inhalte).Ein Protokoll versendeter E-Mails führen (Empfänger, Betreff, Status – keine Inhalte)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:733
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-subscriptions.php:365
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-subscriptions.php:367
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:734
msgid "Let visitors subscribe to a meal plan and receive day e-mails (double opt-in)."
msgstr "Besucher können einen Essensplan abonnieren und Tages-E-Mails erhalten (Double-Opt-in)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:740
msgid "Activation"
msgstr "Aktivierung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:744
msgid "Enable Subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos aktivieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:745
msgid "Allow visitors to subscribe to meal plans and run the sending schedule."
msgstr "Besuchern erlauben, Essenspläne zu abonnieren, und den Versandzeitplan ausführen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:753
msgid "Sending Rules"
msgstr "Versandregeln"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:754
msgid "Each rule combines a trigger (when to send), a subject and an e-mail template. Triggers are relative to the subscribed plan; templates share the same placeholders (e.g. {{ greeting }}, {{ plan_url }}, {{ meal_list_html }}, {{ shopping_list_html }})."
msgstr "Jede Regel kombiniert einen Auslöser (wann gesendet wird), einen Betreff und ein E-Mail-Template. Auslöser beziehen sich auf den abonnierten Plan; Templates teilen sich dieselben Platzhalter (z.B. {{ greeting }}, {{ plan_url }}, {{ meal_list_html }}, {{ shopping_list_html }})."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:762
msgid "Pages & Redirects"
msgstr "Seiten & Weiterleitungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:766
msgid "Privacy Policy URL"
msgstr "URL der Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:767
msgid "Linked from the consent checkbox on the subscribe form."
msgstr "Wird von der Einwilligungs-Checkbox im Anmeldeformular verlinkt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:775
msgid "Redirect After Subscribing"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Anmeldung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:776
msgid "Page to redirect to after the subscribe form is submitted. Leave empty to show an inline confirmation message instead."
msgstr "Seite, zu der nach dem Absenden des Anmeldeformulars weitergeleitet wird. Leer lassen, um stattdessen eine Inline-Bestätigung anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:786
msgid "Redirect After Confirmation"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Bestätigung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:787
msgid "Page to redirect to after a subscriber confirms via the e-mail link. Leave empty to show the built-in confirmation page."
msgstr "Seite, zu der nach der Bestätigung über den E-Mail-Link weitergeleitet wird. Leer lassen, um die eingebaute Bestätigungsseite anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:797
msgid "Redirect After Unsubscribing"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Abmeldung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:798
msgid "Page to redirect to after a subscriber unsubscribes via the e-mail link. Leave empty to show the built-in confirmation page."
msgstr "Seite, zu der nach der Abmeldung über den E-Mail-Link weitergeleitet wird. Leer lassen, um die eingebaute Bestätigungsseite anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:808
msgid "Recipe Rating Page"
msgstr "Rezept-Bewertungsseite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:809
msgid "Page that contains the [mmm_recipe_rating_form] shortcode. The \"rate this recipe\" links in the e-mails point here. Leave empty to omit those links."
msgstr "Seite mit dem Shortcode [mmm_recipe_rating_form]. Die „Rezept bewerten“-Links in den E-Mails verweisen hierher. Leer lassen, um diese Links wegzulassen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:819
msgid "Photo Upload Page"
msgstr "Foto-Upload-Seite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:820
msgid "Page that contains the [mmm_photo_upload_form] shortcode. The \"upload your photo\" links in the e-mails and the gallery upload button point here. Leave empty to omit those links."
msgstr "Seite mit dem Shortcode [mmm_photo_upload_form]. Die „Foto hochladen“-Links in den E-Mails und der Upload-Button der Galerie führen hierhin. Leer lassen, um diese Links wegzulassen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:831
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-photos.php:288
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-photos.php:299
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-photos.php:448
msgid "Meal Photos"
msgstr "Mahlzeiten-Fotos"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:835
msgid "Auto-Approve Meal Photos"
msgstr "Mahlzeiten-Fotos automatisch freigeben"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:836
msgid "Publish uploaded meal photos immediately, without an admin approving them first."
msgstr "Hochgeladene Mahlzeiten-Fotos sofort veröffentlichen, ohne vorherige Freigabe durch einen Admin."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:847
msgid "Lifecycle & Privacy"
msgstr "Lebenszyklus & Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:851
msgid "Confirmation Window (hours)"
msgstr "Bestätigungsfenster (Stunden)"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:852
msgid "Unconfirmed subscriptions are deleted after this many hours."
msgstr "Unbestätigte Abos werden nach so vielen Stunden gelöscht."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:860
msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Aufbewahrung (Tage)"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:861
msgid "Completed/unsubscribed records are deleted after this many days."
msgstr "Abgeschlossene/abgemeldete Einträge werden nach so vielen Tagen gelöscht."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:869
msgid "Store Consent IP"
msgstr "Einwilligungs-IP speichern"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:870
msgid "Also store the IP address as part of the consent record (optional)."
msgstr "Zusätzlich die IP-Adresse als Teil des Einwilligungsnachweises speichern (optional)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:879
msgid "E-Mail Content"
msgstr "E-Mail-Inhalt"

